## Installation

### 1. Install Python Dependencies

```bash
pip install requests colorama rich beautifulsoup4 lxml
```

### 2. Install Ollama

Download Ollama from:

https://ollama.com/

### 3. Download a Language Model

```bash
ollama pull llama3.2
```

### 4. Start Ollama

```bash
ollama serve
```

If Ollama is already running as a background service, you do not need to start it again.

### 5. Run CyberLearn AI

```bash
python cyberlearn.py
```

Replace `cyberlearn.py` with the actual name of your Python file.

## Configuration

CyberLearn AI supports the following environment variables:

| Variable      | Default                  | Description              |
| ------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------ |
| `OLLAMA_URL`  | `http://localhost:11434` | Ollama API address       |
| `CYBER_MODEL` | `llama3.2`               | Preferred language model |

Example configuration on Linux:

```bash
export OLLAMA_URL="http://localhost:11434"
export CYBER_MODEL="llama3.2"
python cyberlearn.py
```

